+// Look. The Richer preset (hdrtonemap + automatic glare + forced shadow
+// values) is gone. lookpreset stays 0 so a saved "1" cannot select it.
+// LOOK_keep is only the anti-aliasing chain: clear postfx, glare off,
+// FXAA in Native only when lookfxaa is 1 (off by default: it softened the
+// textures) and DLAA/DLSS is not applied. It does not touch RT,
+// NRD, lights, or shadow settings. HUD/chat stay after postfx.
+// config.cfg and restore.cfg load after this file and may still define
+// the old LOOK_apply. LOOK_retire puts that alias back without rewriting
+// the other saved settings. The glare command itself stays for a later
