+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Settings pages: one look everywhere (model: the Chat Translation page).
+// - a section title (guisection) for each group, in the order a player looks;
+// - one setting per line, or aligned columns (MENU_col, HUD_gap);
+// - short grey notes (^f4) under what they explain, kept under ~75 letters;
+// - buttons ending in "..." open another page;
+// - a long page is cut into views shown as tabs at the top (MENU_tab): the
+//   open view is green, the controls stay in the same page for the search;
+// - every page has the same width (MENU_width) so the letters keep one size
+//   (the menu window shrinks a page to fit its widest line).
